---
pagination:
  data: companyIndex.countries
  size: 1
  alias: land
  # Zonder dit komt alleen de EERSTE pagina van de reeks in collections.all,
  # en dus maar een van de honderden in sitemap.xml.
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ land.url }}"
layout: layout.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Film and TV companies in {{ land.inName }}"
  seo_title: "Film, TV and Media Companies in {{ land.inName }}: {{ land.count }} Studios, Producers and Post Houses | Tubes"
  description: "{{ land.count }} film, TV and media companies in {{ land.inName }}: studios, production companies and post-production houses, with services, credits and links to their own sites."
---
{#- Landpagina: alles in een land, gegroepeerd per type. Dit is wat iemand
    zoekt met "production companies in Portugal", en tegelijk de route waarlangs
    Google de bedrijfspagina's van dat land bereikt. -#}
<article class="section theme-light company-page">
  <div class="container company-inner">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/companies/">Companies</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">{{ land.name }}</span>
    </nav>
    <header class="company-head">
      <p class="company-kicker"><a href="/companies/">Directory</a></p>
      <h1>Film, TV and media companies in {{ land.inName }}</h1>
      <p class="company-summary">
        {{ land.count }} companies in {{ land.inName }}:
        {%- for g in land.byType %} {{ g.count }} {{ g.label.plural | lower }}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}.
        Each one checked on its own website. Filter and compare them in the
        <a href="/compare-media-production-companies/">search tool</a>.
      </p>
    </header>

    {%- if land.incentive %}
    <h2>What {{ land.inName }} pays back</h2>
    <p>
      {{ land.inName | capitalize_first }} runs the {{ land.incentive.scheme }}{% if land.incentive.rate_label %}, worth {{ land.incentive.rate_label }}{% endif %}{% if land.incentive.mechanism %} as a {{ land.incentive.mechanism | lower }}{% endif %}.
      Work out the net value on your own spend in the <a href="/compare-film-incentives/">incentive comparison</a>, and find places to shoot in the <a href="/compare-film-tv-locations/">locations guide</a>.
    </p>
    {%- endif %}

    {%- for g in land.byType %}
    <h2>{{ g.label.plural }} in {{ land.inName }} <span class="company-count">{{ g.count }}</span></h2>
    <p>{{ g.label.blurb }}</p>
    {% set lijst = g.companies %}{% set toonLand = false %}{% set toonSpecialisme = true %}{% set meer = 0 %}
    {% include "partials/company-links.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}

    <p class="company-back">
      <a href="/companies/">All countries</a> &middot;
      <a href="/compare-media-production-companies/">Search all {{ companyIndex.total }} companies</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</article>

<section class="section theme-teal">
  <div class="container company-cta">
    <h2>Producing in {{ land.inName }}?</h2>
    <p>Tubes brings budgeting, planning and cost control together in one platform, so a co-production or a service shoot becomes a working budget instead of a guess.</p>
    <p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Request a Demo</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
